{"slug":"2022-residents-1","title":"2022 Residents","nav":"2022 Residents","desc":"PENUMBRA WORKSPACE PROGRAM 2022 © Donavon Smallwood","img":"https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/55d61c1be4b0cafd401171f5/d825518e-acd9-49d1-bf3b-2361fc293d5c/languor7.jpg","updated":1747863743916,"blocks":[{"t":"text","html":"<h3>Penumbra Foundation is pleased to announce <br/>the 2022 Workspace Program artists</h3>"},{"t":"hr"},{"t":"row","cols":[{"span":6,"blocks":[{"t":"row","cols":[{"span":2,"blocks":[{"t":"text","html":"<p><strong>Kierra <br/>Brankard <br/></strong>(FL)</p>"}]},{"span":2,"blocks":[{"t":"text","html":"<p><strong>Kate <br/>Ovaska<br/></strong>(NY) </p>"}]},{"span":2,"blocks":[{"t":"text","html":"<p><strong>Cati <br/>Bestard <br/></strong>(MA)</p>"}]}]}]},{"span":4,"blocks":[{"t":"row","cols":[{"span":2,"blocks":[{"t":"text","html":"<p><strong>Daniel  <br/>Hojnacki<br/></strong>(NM)</p>"}]},{"span":2,"blocks":[{"t":"text","html":"<p><strong>Donavon Smallwood <br/></strong>(NY)</p>"}]}]}]},{"span":2,"blocks":[{"t":"text","html":"<p><strong><em>juliana roccoforte novello <br/></em></strong>(NY)</p>"}]}]},{"t":"hr"},{"t":"row","cols":[{"span":2,"blocks":[{"t":"img","src":"https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/55d61c1be4b0cafd401171f5/1653431424201-0J9LNGSLYD4FVN9AMI6F/SW0C9116.jpg","alt":"Image © Kierra Brankard. Courtesy of the artist.","cap":"<figcaption>\n<p>Image © Kierra Brankard. Courtesy of the artist.</p>\n</figcaption>","w":1000,"h":1500,"href":"/kierra-branker","fp":"0.5,0.5"}]},{"span":2,"blocks":[{"t":"img","src":"https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/55d61c1be4b0cafd401171f5/1653442813331-LWCXQO259E55Q5O5I75K/ovaska_17a.jpg","alt":"Image © Kate Ovaska. Courtesy of the artist.","cap":"<figcaption>\n<p>Image © Kate Ovaska. Courtesy of the artist.</p>\n</figcaption>","w":3000,"h":2400,"href":"/kate-ovaska","fp":"0.5,0.5"}]},{"span":2,"blocks":[{"t":"img","src":"https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/55d61c1be4b0cafd401171f5/0ac939e8-04b2-4863-9331-e91f91cd3f23/15_CatiBestard.jpg","alt":"Image © Cati Bestard. Courtesy of the artist.","cap":"<figcaption>\n<p>Image © Cati Bestard. Courtesy of the artist.</p>\n</figcaption>","w":3618,"h":5427,"href":"/cati-bestard","fp":"0.5,0.5"}]},{"span":2,"blocks":[{"t":"img","src":"https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/55d61c1be4b0cafd401171f5/1653426820742-6UL6HG3FRB15RORRA5FB/Hojnacki_Daniel_12.jpg","alt":"Image © Daniel Hojnacki. Courtesy of the artist.","cap":"<figcaption>\n<p>Image © Daniel Hojnacki. Courtesy of the artist.</p>\n</figcaption>","w":1322,"h":1620,"href":"/daniel-hojnacki","fp":"0.5,0.5"}]},{"span":2,"blocks":[{"t":"img","src":"https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/55d61c1be4b0cafd401171f5/1653449213917-YC0SXTC7ERS6A6HH5LXX/languor13.jpg","alt":"Image © Donavon Smallwood. Courtesy of the artist.","cap":"<figcaption>\n<p>Image © Donavon Smallwood. Courtesy of the artist.</p>\n</figcaption>","w":1185,"h":1510,"href":"/donavon-smallwood","fp":"0.5,0.5"}]},{"span":2,"blocks":[{"t":"img","src":"https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/55d61c1be4b0cafd401171f5/1654025611175-XQV0VNW0LACAF9QQ8L1A/14.jpg","alt":"Image © juliana roccoforte novello . Courtesy of the artist.","cap":"<figcaption>\n<p>Image © <em>juliana roccoforte novello</em>. Courtesy of the artist.</p>\n</figcaption>","w":11648,"h":8736,"href":"/juliana-roccoforte-novello","fp":"0.5,0.5"}]}]},{"t":"hr"},{"t":"text","html":"<p>The 202 jury included Klea McKenna (Artist, represented by Euqinom Gallery and Gitterman Gallery) and Adama Delphine Fawundu (Artist and Educator (Columbia University, NY). In speaking to the selection process, the jurors had this to say:</p><p>Penumbra Foundation would like to thank all of the artists who applied this year, and we hope that those whose work was not selected at this time will continue to apply to the Workspace Program in the future.</p>"},{"t":"hr"},{"t":"text","html":"<p>Scroll down for more information about each of the selected artists.</p>"},{"t":"hr"},{"t":"text","html":"<h3>SPONSORS</h3><p>This program is supported by<strong> Henry Nias Foundation</strong>, <strong>The Phillip and Edith Leonian Foundation</strong>,<strong> Joy of Giving Something</strong> and<strong> Roz Leibowitz</strong>. </p>"},{"t":"row","cols":[{"span":4,"blocks":[{"t":"img","src":"https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/55d61c1be4b0cafd401171f5/3e9ca9ed-76ae-456b-bc17-fe0ef1988dc2/JGS-white-500x500.jpg","alt":"2022 Residents — image 7","cap":"","w":500,"h":500,"href":null,"fp":"0.5,0.5"}]},{"span":3,"blocks":[{"t":"img","src":"https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/55d61c1be4b0cafd401171f5/9d50d4b8-fff2-4da1-a675-a5710d485775/Leonian.jpg","alt":"2022 Residents — image 8","cap":"","w":344,"h":232,"href":null,"fp":"0.5,0.5"}]}]},{"t":"text","html":"<p><strong>Thanks</strong> <strong>to the following artists</strong> for their support to Penumbra Foundation and in particular to the 2020 Penumbra Workspace Program:</p><p>Sophie Barbasch, Erica Baum, Marina Berio, Rachelle Bussières, Tim Carpenter, Dillon DeWaters, Larry Fink, Jenia Fridlyand, Theresa Ganz, Edward Grazda, Aspen Mays, Raymond Meeks, Andrew Moore, Adam Putnam, Meghann Riepenhoff, Almudena Romero, Liz Sales, Victoria Sambunaris, Victor Sira, Joni Sternbach, Eric Taubman, Pedro Weiner and Samira Yamin.</p>"}]}